6
00:01:16,910 --> 00:01:18,161
Baliw lahat!

7
00:01:24,542 --> 00:01:28,463
Baliw lahat ng nasa school na 'to,
pare-pareho mga teacher at estudyante!

8
00:01:28,546 --> 00:01:29,839
Di bale na!

9
00:01:29,923 --> 00:01:30,882
Ilalantad ko lahat.

10
00:01:30,965 --> 00:01:34,385
Ilalantad ko lahat ng nangyari
sa school na 'to.

11
00:01:58,493 --> 00:02:00,078
KANG IN-HAN

12
00:02:01,412 --> 00:02:06,084
EPISODE 1
NEWBIE PARTY: TRUTH OR DARE

13
00:02:27,897 --> 00:02:30,483
Maso-solve n'yo 'tong problem na 'to
pag na-graph n'yo na

14
00:02:30,567 --> 00:02:32,152
'yong absolute value ng f(x)…

15
00:02:39,075 --> 00:02:40,326
'Yong sagot na 'yon…

16
00:02:40,410 --> 00:02:42,871
"Nakita ko ang pag-iyak mo
Isang makinang na luha

17
00:02:43,705 --> 00:02:45,331
Ang tumakip sa asul na mata

18
00:02:46,374 --> 00:02:48,459
At naisip kong lumitaw nga ito…"

19
00:03:24,829 --> 00:03:26,331
FIRST SEMESTER OPENING CEREMONY

20
00:03:33,588 --> 00:03:37,926
Sa Jooshin High, ang pinakaprestihiyosong
pribadong institusyon ng South Korea

21
00:03:38,551 --> 00:03:42,972
na kilala sa kasaysayan at tradisyon nito,
simula na ng bagong semester.

22
00:03:47,227 --> 00:03:50,480
Bago ang simulang ito,

23
00:03:50,563 --> 00:03:52,941
isinabuhay ang motto
ng Jooshin na "noblesse oblige,"

24
00:03:53,691 --> 00:03:55,902
sa pagbubukas ng bagong semester.

25
00:03:56,653 --> 00:03:58,863
Ipinakikilala ang bago nating
scholarship student

26
00:03:58,947 --> 00:04:00,907
na pinili sa pamamagitan ng…

27
00:04:03,284 --> 00:04:04,911
napakahigpit na selection process.

28
00:04:08,748 --> 00:04:09,624
Mr. Kang Ha?

29
00:04:10,792 --> 00:04:11,626
Yes, ma'am.

30
00:04:17,173 --> 00:04:21,010
Ba't kumukuha pa sila ng mga scholar
kung di naman sila tumatagal?

31
00:04:21,094 --> 00:04:23,513
"Dapat may pagkakataon din
ang mahihirap na bata."

32
00:04:23,596 --> 00:04:26,516
"Noblesse oblige." Di nila bibitawan 'yon.

33
00:04:27,183 --> 00:04:28,851
-'Yong principal?
-Hindi.

34
00:04:28,935 --> 00:04:30,103
Mga may-ari ng Jooshin.

35
00:04:30,770 --> 00:04:31,854
Mga magulang ni Ri-an.

36
00:04:32,397 --> 00:04:33,648
Good morning,

37
00:04:34,148 --> 00:04:37,151
classmates, seniors, at underclassmen.

38
00:04:39,195 --> 00:04:40,196
Ako si Kang Ha.

39
00:04:43,658 --> 00:04:46,077
Ako ang unang nakatanggap
ng perfect score sa…

40
00:04:53,001 --> 00:04:54,127
Uy.

41
00:05:10,101 --> 00:05:12,145
Bilang unang estudyanteng
nakakuha ng perfect…

42
00:05:18,860 --> 00:05:20,278
-Nandito ka.
-Late ka.

43
00:05:24,991 --> 00:05:25,992
Ituloy mo.

44
00:05:26,993 --> 00:05:28,036
Gumagana na.

45
00:05:28,619 --> 00:05:30,413
Okay. Ako…

46
00:05:30,496 --> 00:05:33,750
Perfect score. Tama.
Oo, nakakuha ako ng perfect score.

47
00:05:33,833 --> 00:05:36,461
-Ang cute ng ngiti niya.
-Masaya at excited akong…

48
00:05:36,544 --> 00:05:38,463
Di ba para siyang puppy?

49
00:05:38,546 --> 00:05:42,508
…lumipat sa best private high school
ng Korea, ang Jooshin High.

50
00:05:42,592 --> 00:05:44,802
Nagsimula ako dito nang may perfect score,

51
00:05:45,386 --> 00:05:48,765
at gagawin ko lahat
para mapanatili 'yon hanggang sa huli.

52
00:05:48,848 --> 00:05:50,808
Sana maging masaya ang taong 'to.

53
00:05:57,440 --> 00:05:58,941
SABIHIN MO ANO BA'NG NANGYAYARI

54
00:05:59,025 --> 00:06:01,486
SAGUTIN MO 'YONG PHONE, JAE-I
BA'T MO GINAGAWA 'TO?

55
00:06:04,989 --> 00:06:07,241
Diyan nagtatapos ang seremonya natin.

56
00:06:07,325 --> 00:06:10,870
Students, pumunta na kayo
sa mga klase ninyo.

57
00:06:12,914 --> 00:06:14,499
-Ano'ng ginagawa mo? Upo.
-Bakit?

58
00:06:14,582 --> 00:06:15,416
Basta maupo ka.

59
00:06:16,292 --> 00:06:17,126
Bakit?

60
00:06:18,836 --> 00:06:20,046
Sira-ulong 'yon. Lintik.

61
00:06:29,889 --> 00:06:32,767
Ano'ng ginagawa mo?
Mine-message ko si Ye-ji.

62
00:06:37,063 --> 00:06:37,939
Excuse me.

63
00:06:38,648 --> 00:06:41,484
Hi. Nakita mo kanina, di ba?
Ako 'yong bagong scholar.

64
00:06:41,567 --> 00:06:42,610
English 'yong una ko,

65
00:06:42,693 --> 00:06:45,446
pero di ko alam saan pupunta.
May English ka ba ngayon?

66
00:06:46,656 --> 00:06:47,907
Masyado kang masaya.

67
00:06:48,574 --> 00:06:50,535
Matatagalan bago mo malaman
'yong lugar mo.

68
00:06:50,618 --> 00:06:51,452
Ano?

69
00:06:52,036 --> 00:06:54,455
Malaman 'yong ano?
Pare? Aalis ka na lang?

70
00:07:01,129 --> 00:07:03,714
Ipapakita nila kung saan
'yong classroom mo.

71
00:07:04,715 --> 00:07:06,134
Pwedeng makuha number mo?

72
00:07:06,217 --> 00:07:07,927
Ano? Number ko?

73
00:07:08,761 --> 00:07:10,054
Ano'ng mukha 'yan?

74
00:07:10,555 --> 00:07:12,640
Sure akong marami kang gustong malaman.

75
00:07:12,723 --> 00:07:14,183
Magtanong ka lang.

76
00:07:14,267 --> 00:07:15,268
Talaga?

77
00:07:16,602 --> 00:07:17,437
Thanks.

78
00:07:17,520 --> 00:07:19,605
-Ano'ng username mo?
-Ifa-follow ka namin.

79
00:07:20,189 --> 00:07:22,233
-Wala akong account.
-Wala?

80
00:07:22,316 --> 00:07:23,151
Wala.

81
00:07:25,278 --> 00:07:26,404
Heto'ng number ko.

82
00:07:26,487 --> 00:07:27,905
Thanks. See you.

83
00:07:30,241 --> 00:07:31,075
-Wow.
-Wow.

84
00:07:31,951 --> 00:07:33,453
Kakaiba talaga siya.

85
00:07:42,712 --> 00:07:43,546
Ano 'to?

86
00:07:50,219 --> 00:07:51,053
Di bale na.

87
00:07:55,433 --> 00:07:56,267
Good morning.

88
00:07:57,185 --> 00:07:59,604
Scholar? Bawal ka dito.

89
00:07:59,687 --> 00:08:01,355
Pero may English ako ngayon.

90
00:08:01,439 --> 00:08:03,399
Nasa dulo ng hall 'yong Standard A.

91
00:08:03,483 --> 00:08:04,775
Special A 'to.

92
00:08:05,526 --> 00:08:06,360
Di pala dito?

93
00:08:08,905 --> 00:08:11,240
-Hi.
-'Yong scholar.

94
00:08:11,324 --> 00:08:12,241
Ba't siya nandito?

95
00:08:27,173 --> 00:08:28,216
Diyan ako nakaupo.

96
00:08:29,300 --> 00:08:30,468
Gano'n ba?

97
00:08:30,551 --> 00:08:31,761
Sorry.

98
00:08:33,012 --> 00:08:33,888
Sa friend ko 'yan.

99
00:08:36,057 --> 00:08:37,308
A, talaga?

100
00:08:37,391 --> 00:08:38,476
Ang dungis.

101
00:08:39,352 --> 00:08:40,311
Tingnan mo 'yong tie.

102
00:08:42,522 --> 00:08:44,815
Talagang pinapakita niyang dukha siya.

103
00:08:46,776 --> 00:08:48,319
Tingin ko kakaiba rin amoy niya.

104
00:08:48,402 --> 00:08:50,029
Amoy palaboy siya, 'no?

105
00:08:57,537 --> 00:08:58,913
Ni walang bag hook.

106
00:09:34,949 --> 00:09:36,742
Nabawasan mo ng 1.25 segundo.

107
00:09:38,369 --> 00:09:40,329
Lunch tayo, Ri-an.

108
00:09:44,041 --> 00:09:45,084
Wala ka nang klase?

109
00:09:47,295 --> 00:09:50,006
Oo. Ri-an, may isa ka pang klase, di ba?

110
00:09:51,382 --> 00:09:53,259
International politics mamayang 4:00 p.m.

111
00:10:01,726 --> 00:10:04,854
Kakaiba si Woo-jin ngayon.
May dine-date ba siya?

112
00:10:06,397 --> 00:10:09,150
Kumusta si Jae-i?
Wala ka pa ring balita sa kanya?

113
00:10:26,834 --> 00:10:29,211
Kung di pa rin kayo nagpapansinan,

114
00:10:30,421 --> 00:10:31,339
dapat siguro

115
00:10:32,548 --> 00:10:36,636
bantayan ko 'yong trono
habang wala 'yong reyna.

116
00:10:38,137 --> 00:10:40,139
Ano ba'ng dapat gawin para mapaibig ka?

117
00:10:41,557 --> 00:10:43,351
Nag-work out ako buong bakasyon.

118
00:10:44,185 --> 00:10:47,396
Ba't di mo tingnan
kung sulit 'yong pagod ko?

119
00:10:50,483 --> 00:10:51,817
Di ko na kailangang tingnan.

120
00:10:52,902 --> 00:10:56,364
Alam kong mas maganda
'yong katawan mo kaysa sa mga models.

121
00:10:57,406 --> 00:10:58,240
Kaya,

122
00:10:59,533 --> 00:11:00,660
wag ka na'ng magbiro.

123
00:11:02,745 --> 00:11:06,082
Di ako nagbibiro. Pero dapat yata
sabihin kong gano'n nga.

124
00:11:08,668 --> 00:11:09,585
Sa'n ka pupunta?

125
00:11:09,669 --> 00:11:10,836
May lakad ako.

126
00:11:11,712 --> 00:11:13,589
Di ako aalis dahil napahiya ako.

127
00:11:39,657 --> 00:11:40,574
Jae-i!

128
00:11:58,759 --> 00:12:01,220
Ano'ng ginagawa mong mag-isa sa US
nang tatlong buwan?

129
00:12:01,303 --> 00:12:03,431
May mga mas batang pinsan ako sa Irvine.

130
00:12:03,973 --> 00:12:04,890
Busy ako.

131
00:12:06,475 --> 00:12:09,270
Nagtatampo ako. Di mo pinansin
'yong mga tawag at messages ko.

132
00:12:09,353 --> 00:12:11,647
Siguro di kami mahalaga ni Woo-jin.

133
00:12:12,481 --> 00:12:14,316
Di mo rin ba pinansin si Ri-an?

134
00:12:17,069 --> 00:12:20,406
Kaya pala. Kayang humukay sa lupa
ng negative energy niya.

135
00:12:20,489 --> 00:12:22,324
Ano ba'ng nangyari? Nag-away ba kayo?

136
00:12:22,408 --> 00:12:27,663
Kahit na, package deal kayo.
Paanong tatlong buwan kayong di nag-usap?

137
00:12:27,747 --> 00:12:29,832
May sasabihin ako sa buong grupo.

138
00:12:29,915 --> 00:12:30,750
Talaga?

139
00:12:30,833 --> 00:12:34,253
May gagawin ako sa umaga. Magkita tayo
sa Linggo ng hapon sa track.

140
00:12:35,296 --> 00:12:36,130
Sa track?

141
00:12:40,760 --> 00:12:43,929
Bakit sa track?
At bakit kailangan kong tipunin lahat?

142
00:12:52,938 --> 00:12:55,524
Assemblyman Lee, mag-group photo tayo.

143
00:12:55,608 --> 00:12:56,692
Say "kimchi."

144
00:12:56,776 --> 00:12:58,444
-One, two, three.
-Kimchi!

145
00:12:58,527 --> 00:12:59,779
Kimchi!

146
00:12:59,862 --> 00:13:01,781
Tapos na. Palakpakan ang lahat.

147
00:13:01,864 --> 00:13:03,032
Ang bait mong bata.

148
00:13:03,532 --> 00:13:05,284
-Bye.
-Maraming salamat.

149
00:13:05,367 --> 00:13:07,244
-Siya ang panganay ko.
-Diyos ko.

150
00:13:07,328 --> 00:13:09,830
Attention. Libre ba lahat
sa Linggo ng hapon?

151
00:13:09,914 --> 00:13:11,582
Magkita tayong lahat.

152
00:13:12,875 --> 00:13:17,797
Tumaas ang sales ng cell phone
ng Jooshin Electronics nitong huli.

153
00:13:17,880 --> 00:13:19,465
Lalo na sa Barcelona.

154
00:13:19,548 --> 00:13:21,050
Nabasa ko 'yan kaninang umaga.

155
00:13:21,133 --> 00:13:23,761
E, ang France?

156
00:13:23,844 --> 00:13:26,222
Ilo-launch 'yong bakery brand
ng Jooshin sa Paris…

157
00:13:26,305 --> 00:13:27,139
Sandali lang.

158
00:13:28,516 --> 00:13:30,768
Nakabalik na si Jung Jae-i natin.

159
00:13:31,644 --> 00:13:34,563
Magkita tayo sa track sa Linggo.
Wag kang male-late, okay?

160
00:13:45,533 --> 00:13:47,576
E, ito, Miss Jae-i?

161
00:13:47,660 --> 00:13:49,453
Bagay 'to sa skin tone mo.

162
00:13:55,000 --> 00:13:56,210
Ito na lang.

163
00:14:09,807 --> 00:14:12,434
Sana magustuhan n'yo 'yong pagkain.

164
00:14:12,518 --> 00:14:14,562
Madalang ako sa mga ganitong karangyaan.

165
00:14:14,645 --> 00:14:17,565
Masarap na pagkain sa magandang hardin,

166
00:14:17,648 --> 00:14:20,651
at higit sa lahat, kasama ka
sa okasyong 'to, Chairman Jung.

167
00:14:20,734 --> 00:14:21,777
Thank you.

168
00:14:21,861 --> 00:14:25,197
Ilang beses nang nabanggit
ni Assemblyman Lee na mag-lunch,

169
00:14:25,281 --> 00:14:27,366
pero naging busy sa trabaho,
noon pa dapat 'to.

170
00:14:27,867 --> 00:14:30,911
Napakaganda ng anak mo.

171
00:14:31,579 --> 00:14:33,372
Mana siya sa nanay niya.

172
00:14:35,291 --> 00:14:37,042
Tingin mo nagmana siya sa 'kin?

173
00:14:37,668 --> 00:14:39,420
Sa tingin ko…

174
00:14:42,006 --> 00:14:43,132
mas maganda si Jae-i.

175
00:14:45,885 --> 00:14:49,513
Maganda siya at mahusay sa paaralan.
Proud ka siguro.

176
00:14:50,180 --> 00:14:53,893
Sinabi ni Woo-jin
na nasa top sa klase si Jae-i

177
00:14:55,060 --> 00:14:59,189
Buti na lang, ginagawa ng mga bata
'yong tungkulin nila kahit wala kami.

178
00:14:59,690 --> 00:15:01,400
Proud din kami kay Jae-hyeok.

179
00:15:01,483 --> 00:15:04,653
Nagtapos siya sa Hanguk Middle
nang nasa top ng klase niya last year.

180
00:15:04,737 --> 00:15:06,989
Nagtapos po ako
sa Hanguk Middle last year.

181
00:15:07,489 --> 00:15:09,366
Nagtapos ka sa Hanguk Middle School?

182
00:15:09,450 --> 00:15:10,784
Alma mater ko 'yon.

183
00:15:10,868 --> 00:15:13,329
Di ko inaasahang makakakilala ako
ng kapwa alumni dito.

184
00:15:22,296 --> 00:15:23,422
Jae-i?

185
00:15:26,634 --> 00:15:28,135
Di ka ba komportable?

186
00:15:29,053 --> 00:15:31,347
Parang di ka gaanong kumain kanina.

187
00:15:31,430 --> 00:15:32,514
Okay lang ako.

188
00:15:33,557 --> 00:15:36,435
Magtsa-tsaa tayo sa taas.
Maghanda ka at umakyat ka.

189
00:15:37,019 --> 00:15:38,312
Sige. Gagawin ko.

190
00:15:40,105 --> 00:15:41,190
'Yong damit mo…

191
00:15:44,902 --> 00:15:46,278
Ikaw ba pumili?

192
00:15:50,199 --> 00:15:51,867
Magpalit ka muna.

193
00:15:52,451 --> 00:15:55,287
Parang di 'yan bagay
sa okasyong gaya ngayon.

194
00:15:55,788 --> 00:15:57,831
Maraming pumupuna sa maliliit na detalye.

195
00:15:57,915 --> 00:16:00,584
'Yong pinili mong damit,
'yong sense of style mo.

196
00:16:01,418 --> 00:16:05,965
Tingin ko mas maganda kung magsuot ka
ng mas classy, gaya ng nanay mo.

197
00:16:06,799 --> 00:16:08,342
Aling nanay?

198
00:16:11,011 --> 00:16:11,845
'Yong stepmom ko?

199
00:16:11,929 --> 00:16:12,846
'Yan na naman!

200
00:16:16,433 --> 00:16:20,729
Siyempre 'yong asawa ko,
'yong nanay na nagpalaki sa 'yo.

201
00:16:21,313 --> 00:16:23,023
Di 'yong nagsilang sa 'yo.

202
00:16:29,697 --> 00:16:32,324
Sa tingin ko, dapat magbihis ka na.
Ngayon na.

203
00:16:33,283 --> 00:16:34,368
Gagawin ko na po.

204
00:16:36,036 --> 00:16:37,287
Habang nando'n ka…

205
00:16:44,003 --> 00:16:46,422
magpalit ka na rin ng lipstick.

206
00:16:46,505 --> 00:16:48,257
Tingnan mo 'yong kulay.

207
00:16:49,550 --> 00:16:50,384
Ang cheap.

208
00:16:52,219 --> 00:16:54,263
Gaya ng nanay na nagsilang sa 'yo.

209
00:16:58,183 --> 00:16:59,852
Gusto kong mas magmukhang anak ko

210
00:16:59,935 --> 00:17:02,104
'yong anak ko.

211
00:17:03,022 --> 00:17:03,856
Mas nababagay

212
00:17:04,898 --> 00:17:07,359
na tawaging panganay
na anak na babae ng Jaeyul Group.

213
00:17:14,199 --> 00:17:15,659
Maghanda ka at umakyat ka na.

214
00:17:30,841 --> 00:17:33,177
DUMAMI ANG APPLICANTS
NG JOOSHIN HIGH SA 2024

215
00:18:49,795 --> 00:18:50,838
Nandito ako

216
00:18:52,047 --> 00:18:53,132
para sa trabaho.

217
00:18:53,966 --> 00:18:55,217
Para tumugtog ng piano.

218
00:18:59,638 --> 00:19:02,683
Nagpahinga lang ako saglit.
Aalis na ako.

219
00:19:04,059 --> 00:19:05,185
Mauuna na ako.

220
00:19:09,606 --> 00:19:11,441
Gamitin mo 'to kung gusto mo.

221
00:19:13,694 --> 00:19:14,695
Di bale na.

222
00:19:16,405 --> 00:19:17,531
Pwede mong hubarin 'yan?

223
00:19:19,241 --> 00:19:20,534
-Ano?
-'Yong shirt mo.

224
00:19:21,160 --> 00:19:22,369
Ipahiram mo sa 'kin.

225
00:19:23,287 --> 00:19:24,121
A, ito?

226
00:19:24,204 --> 00:19:27,749
May kailangan akong puntahan agad,
at di tama 'yong suot ko.

227
00:19:29,168 --> 00:19:31,170
A, oo nga. Sa tingin ko nga.

228
00:19:32,087 --> 00:19:36,133
Kaso di ako makakaalis dito
pag hinubad ko 'to, kaya…

229
00:19:38,343 --> 00:19:39,261
Teka, sandali.

230
00:19:55,402 --> 00:19:56,278
Sa tingin ko

231
00:19:58,155 --> 00:19:59,823
mas kailangan mo 'to kaysa sa 'kin.

232
00:20:08,832 --> 00:20:09,708
Ang lamig.

233
00:20:29,269 --> 00:20:32,105
Di ba sila natatakot?
Ba't may gumagawa ng ganito?

234
00:20:34,066 --> 00:20:35,150
Di ko rin alam.

235
00:20:36,401 --> 00:20:39,154
Nakakatuwa.
Pinaparamdam nito na buhay ka.

236
00:20:40,614 --> 00:20:41,949
Jung Jae-i!

237
00:20:44,785 --> 00:20:45,619
Long time no see.

238
00:20:47,412 --> 00:20:49,373
-Miss na miss kita.
-Kumusta ka?

239
00:20:50,916 --> 00:20:53,126
Kakaiba 'yong suot mo ngayon.

240
00:21:32,332 --> 00:21:35,752
Ang tagal na nating di nagkita-kita.
Gusto mong gumimik pagkatapos?

241
00:21:36,336 --> 00:21:38,130
Dapat mag-enjoy tayo ngayon.

242
00:21:38,213 --> 00:21:39,047
Jung Jae-i.

243
00:21:41,091 --> 00:21:42,467
May sasabihin ka ba sa 'kin?

244
00:21:46,013 --> 00:21:47,556
-He-ra.
-Ano 'yon?

245
00:21:47,639 --> 00:21:49,308
Hinahamon ko si Ri-an sa pustahan.

246
00:21:50,934 --> 00:21:52,978
Pustahan? Anong klaseng pustahan?

247
00:21:53,061 --> 00:21:54,604
Matutupad ang wish ng mananalo.

248
00:21:55,772 --> 00:21:56,606
Anong wish?

249
00:21:58,275 --> 00:21:59,651
Sasabihin ko kung manalo ako.

250
00:22:00,235 --> 00:22:03,030
Tatlong laps.
Ako sa inside line. 'Yon lang.

251
00:22:03,113 --> 00:22:04,781
Walang objection anumang kalabasan.

252
00:22:04,865 --> 00:22:06,033
Mamaya na kung manalo ka.

253
00:22:06,616 --> 00:22:07,659
Kung manalo ako,

254
00:22:08,994 --> 00:22:10,996
kailangan mong ipaliwanag

255
00:22:12,039 --> 00:22:13,457
kung ano ba'ng ginagawa mo.

256
00:24:15,203 --> 00:24:17,622
Ano ba'ng problema nila ngayon?

257
00:24:18,957 --> 00:24:21,293
-Kailangan ba nilang umabot sa ganito?
-Malay natin.

258
00:26:15,198 --> 00:26:17,993
Uy, ba't gano'n ka mag-drive?

259
00:26:18,076 --> 00:26:19,202
Baka masaktan ka.

260
00:26:19,286 --> 00:26:20,537
Nanalo ako.

261
00:26:21,955 --> 00:26:22,998
Sabi ko, nanalo ako.

262
00:26:24,833 --> 00:26:25,709
Sasabihin ko na ba…

263
00:26:27,752 --> 00:26:28,712
'yong wish ko?

264
00:26:31,923 --> 00:26:34,217
Mag-break na tayo, Ri-an.

265
00:26:51,651 --> 00:26:52,611
He-ra.

266
00:26:52,694 --> 00:26:53,820
-O?
-Tara.

267
00:26:58,158 --> 00:27:01,244
Ano ba'ng nangyari sa kanya
bago siya pumunta sa America?

268
00:27:02,621 --> 00:27:04,998
Ewan ko. Wala akong idea.

269
00:27:06,666 --> 00:27:08,585
Pero ngayon ko lang sila nakitang gano'n.

270
00:27:12,964 --> 00:27:13,882
Ulitin mo.

271
00:27:15,550 --> 00:27:17,844
Mag-break na tayo. Tapusin na natin 'to.

272
00:27:18,887 --> 00:27:19,888
Bakit?

273
00:27:21,556 --> 00:27:23,683
Sabihin mo kung ba't ka nagkakaganyan!

274
00:27:24,768 --> 00:27:28,063
Para kang ibang tao no'ng magkasama tayo,

275
00:27:28,146 --> 00:27:31,316
tapos bigla kang nawala ng tatlong buwan
nang walang paalam,

276
00:27:31,399 --> 00:27:33,234
tapos ito 'yong una mong sasabihin?

277
00:27:34,277 --> 00:27:36,071
Una tayong nagkakilala noong six tayo.

278
00:27:37,155 --> 00:27:39,282
At no'ng summer na naging 15 tayo,

279
00:27:39,991 --> 00:27:41,993
sabi mo gusto mo na ako no'ng una pa lang.

280
00:27:44,329 --> 00:27:45,163
Bakit?

281
00:27:46,915 --> 00:27:48,124
Ba't mo ako nagustuhan?

282
00:27:48,208 --> 00:27:49,793
Walang dahilan. Kasi…

283
00:27:49,876 --> 00:27:50,710
Mismo.

284
00:27:50,794 --> 00:27:51,836
Walang dahilan.

285
00:27:52,879 --> 00:27:57,175
Wala talagang dahilan para magustuhan
o ayawan ang isang tao.

286
00:27:57,258 --> 00:27:58,635
Uy!

287
00:28:00,428 --> 00:28:01,554
Maging magkaibigan tayo.

288
00:28:02,555 --> 00:28:04,057
Friends na lang tayo mula ngayon.

289
00:28:05,517 --> 00:28:07,477
Nanalo ako sa pustahan.

290
00:28:08,478 --> 00:28:09,479
Tumupad ka sa pangako.

291
00:28:10,271 --> 00:28:11,106
Jae-i.

292
00:28:12,148 --> 00:28:13,191
Jung Jae-i!

293
00:28:14,567 --> 00:28:15,485
Buwisit!

294
00:28:51,563 --> 00:28:52,480
Ang galing niya.

295
00:28:52,564 --> 00:28:55,525
Napaka-sexy ng bad boy image
ng Jooshin tyrant ngayon.

296
00:28:55,608 --> 00:28:58,403
Nakita mo 'yong bandage sa kamay niya?
Nasaktan ba siya?

297
00:29:01,573 --> 00:29:03,199
Jae-i. Rooibos.

298
00:29:04,868 --> 00:29:07,787
-Thanks.
-Nakauwi ba kayo nang maayos kahapon?

299
00:29:09,998 --> 00:29:11,291
Mukhang nasaktan si Ri-an.

300
00:29:11,374 --> 00:29:13,209
-May nangyari ba sa inyo…
-He-ra.

301
00:29:14,502 --> 00:29:15,545
Ayokong pag-usapan.

302
00:29:18,339 --> 00:29:20,550
Sige. Mamaya na tayo mag-usap.

303
00:29:44,824 --> 00:29:46,451
Walang special announcement ngayon.

304
00:29:47,494 --> 00:29:50,747
Kung may kailangang magpalit ng klase,
deadline ngayong linggo.

305
00:29:51,247 --> 00:29:54,334
Sikapin nating lahat na maging matagumpay
ulit ang semester na 'to.

306
00:29:54,834 --> 00:29:56,961
Mag-aral kayong mabuti
sa mga klase n'yo ngayon.

307
00:29:59,881 --> 00:30:02,258
Pwede ko bang makausap
'yong class president?

308
00:30:06,721 --> 00:30:08,723
Cello ba ang tutugtugin mo? Ako flute.

309
00:30:08,807 --> 00:30:11,226
Malamang. Wala akong oras
para tumugtog din ng flute.

310
00:30:11,309 --> 00:30:14,020
Excuse me. May tanong ako.

311
00:30:14,103 --> 00:30:15,730
Paano mag-apply sa class change?

312
00:30:16,356 --> 00:30:17,190
Ano?

313
00:30:17,273 --> 00:30:20,360
May mga klase sa rowing at fencing,
pero wala sa schedule ko.

314
00:30:20,443 --> 00:30:22,070
Ba't ako'ng tinatanong mo?

315
00:30:23,404 --> 00:30:24,864
Tanungin mo mga kaibigan mo.

316
00:30:25,907 --> 00:30:26,741
"Kaibigan"?

317
00:30:32,705 --> 00:30:34,123
-Uy.
-Ano na naman?

318
00:30:34,207 --> 00:30:36,084
Saan ako pupunta para magpa-class change?

319
00:30:38,169 --> 00:30:39,587
Heto 'yong key events calendar.

320
00:30:42,715 --> 00:30:43,675
Ju-won.

321
00:30:43,758 --> 00:30:46,052
Pwede mong bantayan
'yong bagong estudyante?

322
00:30:46,135 --> 00:30:49,931
Gusto kong tulungan mo siyang
maging maayos 'yong paglipat niya.

323
00:30:50,932 --> 00:30:52,559
Para di na maulit 'yong nangyari

324
00:30:53,768 --> 00:30:55,103
no'ng nakaraan.

325
00:30:58,022 --> 00:30:59,023
Yes, ma'am.

326
00:31:04,696 --> 00:31:07,574
-Masyado bang makapal?
-Mukhang okay naman.

327
00:31:08,157 --> 00:31:09,868
Tinanong mo na ba si Jae-i?

328
00:31:11,870 --> 00:31:12,704
Walang dahilan.

329
00:31:12,787 --> 00:31:14,497
Wala talagang dahilan

330
00:31:16,040 --> 00:31:17,876
para magustuhan
o ayawan ang isang tao.

331
00:31:23,381 --> 00:31:26,217
Iniwasan ka niya
tapos umalis papuntang US.

332
00:31:26,301 --> 00:31:28,928
Nagkalabuan kayo
no'ng bandang birthday party ko.

333
00:31:29,012 --> 00:31:30,388
Wala kang maisip?

334
00:31:31,347 --> 00:31:33,892
May nagawa ka ba na ikinagalit ni Jae-i?

335
00:31:36,603 --> 00:31:37,729
Di ako sigurado.

336
00:31:37,812 --> 00:31:40,607
Grabe, pare. Kahit ano'ng isip natin,
di natin malalaman 'yan.

337
00:31:40,690 --> 00:31:43,985
Kahit mahilo tayo sa kakaisip,
di natin malalaman ba't naiinis sila.

338
00:31:44,569 --> 00:31:45,945
Hoy!

339
00:31:46,029 --> 00:31:48,907
Sabihin mo na lang,
"Di ko alam ano'ng ginawa ko, pero sorry."

340
00:31:48,990 --> 00:31:50,575
Do'n sila magsasalita.

341
00:31:50,658 --> 00:31:53,161
"Galit ako kasi ganito.
Nagtatampo ako kasi ganito."

342
00:31:53,244 --> 00:31:55,330
Di ko pa rin maintindihan
kahit sabihin nila.

343
00:31:59,751 --> 00:32:00,919
Agree ako kay Yun-seok.

344
00:32:01,586 --> 00:32:03,338
Wag kang mag-isip. Mag-sorry ka lang.

345
00:32:03,421 --> 00:32:05,340
Minsan gusto lang namin ng confirmation.

346
00:32:06,382 --> 00:32:07,216
"Confirmation"?

347
00:32:07,300 --> 00:32:08,760
Kahit itulak ka nila palayo,

348
00:32:08,843 --> 00:32:12,221
sabihin mo lang, "Sorry na.
Mamamatay ako kung wala ka."

349
00:32:12,305 --> 00:32:14,349
Pinapangarap ng mga babae 'yan.

350
00:32:15,141 --> 00:32:16,059
Kahit si Jae-i?

351
00:32:16,142 --> 00:32:17,393
Babae siya, di ba?

352
00:32:17,894 --> 00:32:20,188
Gawin mo bukas.
Magkita tayo sa vacation home.

353
00:32:20,271 --> 00:32:22,690
Mag-party tayo nang maayos.

354
00:32:22,774 --> 00:32:24,108
Parang masaya 'yon.

355
00:32:24,192 --> 00:32:25,234
-Di ba?
-Oo nga.

356
00:32:25,318 --> 00:32:26,611
Dapat may dala ka.

357
00:32:26,694 --> 00:32:29,739
Di naman niya balak umupo do'n, 'no?

358
00:32:31,950 --> 00:32:33,326
Sira-ulo ka!

359
00:32:37,038 --> 00:32:37,872
Tabi.

360
00:32:45,004 --> 00:32:48,007
Hirap ka bang intindihin
'yong takbo ng mundo, Mr. Kang Ha?

361
00:32:49,133 --> 00:32:49,968
Ako?

362
00:32:50,051 --> 00:32:52,887
Di pa umaalis si Ri-an
no'ng tumayo ka sa auditorium.

363
00:32:53,513 --> 00:32:55,723
Pumasok ka sa special classrooms

364
00:32:55,807 --> 00:32:57,517
at umupo na lang kung saan mo gusto.

365
00:32:57,600 --> 00:33:00,603
At ano 'yon ngayon?
Gusto mong umupo sa bleachers?

366
00:33:01,896 --> 00:33:03,648
Oo. Ano'ng mali do'n?

367
00:33:04,232 --> 00:33:05,900
Parang ngayon lang siya ipinanganak.

368
00:33:05,984 --> 00:33:09,112
Fresh ang mukha at walang laman ang utak.
Wala siyang alam.

369
00:33:09,195 --> 00:33:12,365
Tinanong pa niya si Gil Ye-ji
tungkol sa pagpapalit ng klase.

370
00:33:12,448 --> 00:33:14,367
'Yong anak ng may-ari ng Jooshin Mart?

371
00:33:18,079 --> 00:33:21,040
Ano ba'ng gusto mong baguhin
sa mga klase mo?

372
00:33:21,624 --> 00:33:24,919
Napansin ko lang na may klase
sa fencing at rowing.

373
00:33:25,837 --> 00:33:26,671
'Yon?

374
00:33:26,754 --> 00:33:28,923
Walang gano'n sa dati kong school.

375
00:33:29,007 --> 00:33:30,800
Mukhang magandang school nga 'to…

376
00:33:30,883 --> 00:33:32,385
Pumunta ka sa faculty room.

377
00:33:33,177 --> 00:33:36,889
Pero may pera ka ba
para sa mga special class fee?

378
00:33:36,973 --> 00:33:39,559
Nasa 40 milyong won kada semester
'yong rowing.

379
00:33:39,642 --> 00:33:41,352
Tingin ko mas mura 'yong fencing.

380
00:33:41,436 --> 00:33:42,854
Apatnapung milyong won?

381
00:33:43,438 --> 00:33:44,897
Ang mahal.

382
00:33:50,319 --> 00:33:52,321
Makinig kang mabuti, little Kang Ha.

383
00:33:53,698 --> 00:33:56,492
Iba ang school na 'to
sa mga dati mong school.

384
00:33:56,576 --> 00:33:58,161
May sariling rules ang Jooshin.

385
00:33:59,162 --> 00:34:00,204
Anong rules?

386
00:34:00,788 --> 00:34:02,707
Wag mong gagalitin ang sinuman.

387
00:34:03,750 --> 00:34:04,584
Sino?

388
00:34:04,667 --> 00:34:09,172
'Yong mga upper class gaya nina Jae-i,
He-ra, Woo-jin, at lalo na si Ri-an.

389
00:34:09,255 --> 00:34:10,715
Bakit?

390
00:34:10,798 --> 00:34:13,092
Anong "bakit"? Malinaw naman.

391
00:34:13,176 --> 00:34:14,385
Iba sila sa 'tin.

392
00:34:14,469 --> 00:34:16,095
Mga scholar tayo.

393
00:34:16,596 --> 00:34:20,099
Iba 'yong tie natin base sa status natin,
dahil magkaiba tayo.

394
00:34:20,183 --> 00:34:21,601
Navy ang mga scholar.

395
00:34:22,185 --> 00:34:23,352
Sa kanila maroon.

396
00:34:23,978 --> 00:34:27,440
'Yong lolo sa tuhod ni Ri-an
ang nagtayo ng school, kaya isa na siya,

397
00:34:27,523 --> 00:34:30,193
tapos 'yong iba legacy students sila.

398
00:34:30,860 --> 00:34:33,362
Mula sila sa mga pamilyang tumulong
sa Jooshin.

399
00:34:34,030 --> 00:34:36,324
Kaya tayo nakakapag-aral sa school na 'to.

400
00:34:37,992 --> 00:34:40,119
Di ba dapat lang na irespeto sila?

401
00:34:43,081 --> 00:34:43,915
"Respeto."

402
00:34:43,998 --> 00:34:45,416
Wag mo nang isipin!

403
00:34:45,500 --> 00:34:47,919
Wag kang magtanong.
Basta itanim mo sa utak mo.

404
00:34:48,002 --> 00:34:49,670
"Di ako magpapakalat-kalat."

405
00:34:49,754 --> 00:34:52,173
"Gagawin ko lahat para di sila abalahin."

406
00:34:52,256 --> 00:34:54,467
-Mahirap bang intindihin 'yon?
-Hindi.

407
00:34:54,550 --> 00:34:58,554
Respeto o anuman. Naiintindihan ko.

408
00:34:58,638 --> 00:35:01,057
Pero para sabihing wag silang inisin…

409
00:35:01,557 --> 00:35:03,309
Di ba parang sobra naman 'yon?

410
00:35:04,227 --> 00:35:06,562
Lintik, sige, isipin mo nang sobra 'yon.

411
00:35:07,146 --> 00:35:10,441
'Yong mga sobrang sinabi mo,
gawin mo lahat 'yon.

412
00:35:16,531 --> 00:35:18,282
Alam mo ba kung ba't ka nandito?

413
00:35:22,537 --> 00:35:24,831
Dahil may nabakanteng scholarship spot.

414
00:35:26,499 --> 00:35:28,126
Bakit may nabakante?

415
00:35:30,044 --> 00:35:31,003
'Yong bata

416
00:35:32,964 --> 00:35:35,216
na di pinansin 'yong sinabi ko
at nagpasaway…

417
00:35:40,596 --> 00:35:42,181
pinatay ni Ri-an.

418
00:36:03,619 --> 00:36:04,829
Gano'n ba.

419
00:36:07,165 --> 00:36:09,667
Naiintindihan ko, Chan-min. Sinasabi mo

420
00:36:11,043 --> 00:36:15,298
na dapat ko silang pakisamahan
para mapadali 'yong buhay ko dito.

421
00:36:17,925 --> 00:36:19,552
Salamat sa advice.

422
00:36:25,349 --> 00:36:27,226
Naintindihan kaya niya?

423
00:36:27,310 --> 00:36:29,312
Ba't ba ang confident ng gagong 'yon?

424
00:36:36,611 --> 00:36:38,946
Ang tagal ko na dito
pero di pa ako nakapag-hi.

425
00:36:42,617 --> 00:36:44,869
Naaalala n'yo 'yong pangalan ko,
di ba? Kang Ha.

426
00:36:46,245 --> 00:36:47,747
Nice to meet you, Kim Ri-an.

427
00:36:58,966 --> 00:37:00,134
Okay lang siya?

428
00:37:00,801 --> 00:37:02,261
Ano ba'ng ginagawa n'yo?

429
00:37:03,095 --> 00:37:05,139
-Paalisin mo.
-Sorry, Yun-seok.

430
00:37:06,182 --> 00:37:07,141
Walanghiya ka.

431
00:37:07,225 --> 00:37:08,643
Ano ba'ng nangyayari?

432
00:37:08,726 --> 00:37:10,853
-Pinrank n'yo siya, 'no?
-Hindi.

433
00:37:10,937 --> 00:37:13,022
Ano'ng sabi nila? Mga monster kami?

434
00:37:13,522 --> 00:37:15,775
Na kakainin ka namin nang buhay
kung di ka sipsip?

435
00:37:16,651 --> 00:37:17,818
Ha?

436
00:37:18,569 --> 00:37:21,572
Inaasar ka nila. Pinrank ka nila.

437
00:37:23,074 --> 00:37:26,035
Dapat nag-party tayo agad
para di ka nila maasar.

438
00:37:26,535 --> 00:37:27,370
Pwede ka bukas?

439
00:37:28,371 --> 00:37:30,373
May welcome party kami para sa 'yo.

440
00:37:30,957 --> 00:37:31,832
Welcome party?

441
00:37:32,917 --> 00:37:34,669
Kita tayo bukas. Ipapasundo kita.

442
00:37:36,295 --> 00:37:37,213
See you.

443
00:37:38,172 --> 00:37:39,924
Pumunta ka. Maghihintay kami.

444
00:38:06,701 --> 00:38:07,952
Tingin ko pwede na 'to.

445
00:38:08,035 --> 00:38:09,704
Sigurado kang magugustuhan niya 'to?

446
00:38:10,579 --> 00:38:11,414
Si Jae-i?

447
00:38:12,164 --> 00:38:13,082
Siguro?

448
00:38:14,292 --> 00:38:15,459
Hahanapin ko siya.

449
00:38:18,629 --> 00:38:20,715
Siyempre, di 'yan ang style ni Jae-i.

450
00:38:45,948 --> 00:38:49,910
Jung Jae-i. Seryoso ako. Di ko sisimulan
'yong party hangga't wala ka.

451
00:38:51,871 --> 00:38:52,997
Bilisan mo na.

452
00:39:24,570 --> 00:39:26,614
Bawal ang mga electronic device.

453
00:39:26,697 --> 00:39:28,616
Itatago at ibabalik sa 'yo

454
00:39:28,699 --> 00:39:31,369
'yong cell phone
at iba pang devices mo pag umalis ka.

455
00:39:31,452 --> 00:39:32,703
A. Okay.

456
00:39:48,010 --> 00:39:48,844
Ano?

457
00:39:49,387 --> 00:39:52,348
Pumunta talaga 'tong gagong 'to!
Dahil lang inimbitahan ka?

458
00:39:53,808 --> 00:39:54,642
Tabi.

459
00:39:54,725 --> 00:39:57,103
-Chan-min, bilisan mo na.
-Rin-a, hintayin mo ako.

460
00:40:03,567 --> 00:40:05,319
Ano? Dumating talaga siya.

461
00:40:05,403 --> 00:40:06,987
Sira ulo ka. Paano ka pumunta dito?

462
00:40:07,071 --> 00:40:08,989
Unbelie-bubble ka, gago.

463
00:40:38,227 --> 00:40:40,104
Oh my God. He-ra.

464
00:40:40,187 --> 00:40:41,522
Ang ganda niya.

465
00:40:50,906 --> 00:40:53,367
Sa wakas, nandito ka na.
Ang guest of honor namin.

466
00:40:55,995 --> 00:40:57,371
Di ba 'yong puppy 'yon?

467
00:40:58,247 --> 00:41:00,875
-Ang tapang niyang pumunta dito.
-Pumunta talaga siya.

468
00:41:01,709 --> 00:41:04,044
Magiging sobrang saya nito.

469
